 32. Cetology. [MobyDick]


 :: sperm whale, greenland whale, _sequence_ ::
#######################################

 '* * * Utter confusion exists among the historians of this animal" sperm whale, says Surgeon Beale, A.D.'" [MobyDick] 
  " (itintab) 32. Cetology. [MobyDick] 

